

Note that a big endian machine will create data files with
big endian order : 

enceladus$ 
enceladus$ od -Ax -t x1 -v 20220327050956.be 
000000 10 3f d9 95 85 0d 50 00 00 3f ca 45 b0 de d0 00
000010 00 00 00 80 00 10 00 00 00 01 00 00 00
00001d
enceladus$ 
enceladus$ od -Ax -t x1 -v 20220327050458.le
000000 00 00 00 50 0d 85 95 d9 3f 00 00 d0 de b0 45 ca
000010 3f 00 80 00 00 00 00 00 10 00 00 00 01
00001d
enceladus$ 


The first byte is a flag where 0x10 means big endian.

